@startuml
title ITI-65 — Registrar documento

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2962A3
  LifeLineBorderColor #8AAED0
  ParticipantBorderColor #2962A3
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF4FC
  ParticipantFontColor #17324D
}

participant "Document Source\n(Sistema clínico)" as Source
participant "Document Recipient\n(Repositorio MHD)" as Recipient
database "Repositorio\ndocumental" as Repository

Source -> Recipient : POST [base]\nBundle transaction
activate Recipient

note over Source, Recipient
  Bundle transaction:
  • List (SubmissionSet)
  • DocumentReference
  • Documento clínico
  • Recursos CL Core, si corresponde
end note

Recipient -> Recipient : Validar Bundle y perfiles
Recipient -> Recipient : Verificar referencias
Recipient -> Repository : Registrar metadatos y contenido
Repository --> Recipient : Registro confirmado
Recipient --> Source : HTTP 200\nBundle transaction-response
deactivate Recipient
@enduml